  "source": "Local original HLAgent checkout, src/tools/HATK",
  "commit": "a2e176149d1df03b7ac72d8d331638f9f9bd7a9a",
  "patches": [
    "Removed dotenv import and automatic load_dotenv() from encodeHLA.py. The worker sets HLAGENT_MAIN_DIRECTORY explicitly; analysis algorithms are unchanged.",
    "OmnibusTest_BHv5.R: added explicit convergence failure checks after each glm; haplotype-row model and statistics otherwise unchanged.",
    "IMGT2Seq.py: require a supplied local snapshot and remove the network downloader import. Sequence processing is unchanged.",
    "GenerateHAT.py: use DataFrame.applymap instead of DataFrame.map for the pinned pandas 1.5.3 image. Elementwise mapping is unchanged.",
    "NfieldDictionary.py and encodeHLA.py: preserve numeric allele fields longer than three digits, such as DPB1*1000:01. Field count and first-occurrence sequence selection are unchanged."
  ],
